# Solreign "Compliance Training Baton" — acid-green corporate HR voice.
# One popup per training zone outcome, shown above the trainee.

# Head connection: brief stutter + stumble.
solreign-training-baton-head = { $target } receives direct-to-forehead feedback. Please hold all questions.

# Legs connection: short accumulating slowdown.
solreign-training-baton-legs = { $target } transitions to a compliance-appropriate walking pace.

# Hands connection: active held item dropped.
solreign-training-baton-hands = { $target } voluntarily surrenders their equipment for review.

# Hands connection but nothing held: the drill still counts.
solreign-training-baton-hands-empty = { $target } demonstrates exemplary empty-hand readiness. Noted.
